  <text>
    <body>
      <p source="#source-294-329"><seg source="#source-294-329">ゆふぐれを君みおくりて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-329-366"><seg source="#source-329-366">ばらの実の丘にのぼりつ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-366-398"><seg source="#source-366-398">鳩笛のおとに濡れゆく</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-398-432"><seg source="#source-398-432">よは肩の君のほそさよ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-432-467"><seg source="#source-432-467">この赤きばらの木の実を</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-467-504"><seg source="#source-467-504">をとめの日君はめでしに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-504-536"><seg source="#source-504-536">おそ秋の小径に消ゆる</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-536-579"><seg source="#source-536-545">うしろ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-545-557"><rb>姿</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-557-579">の君は悲しき</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-579-614"><seg source="#source-579-614">暮れなやむ丘にたたずみ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-614-650"><seg source="#source-614-650">ばらの実をしみじみとみき</seg></p>
    </body>
